                "evidence": "Cloudflare AI Search is free until **1 December 2026**, when billing starts. These figures come from my research vault, last checked 1 November 2026 (6 days ago, so still current), and I didn't search the web again.\n\n**Free each month:**\n- 5M ingestion tokens\n- 10 GB-month of storage\n- 1,000 semantic queries\n- 1,000 full-text queries\n\n**Cost beyond the free amounts:**\n- Hybrid (vector + keyword) queries: **$0.75 per 1,000**\n- Full-text queries: **$0.10 per 1,000**\n\n**Limits:** up to 50 results per query and 5 custom metadata fields per instance.\n\nThe service runs hybrid (vector + keyword) search over its own storage, R2, or a crawl of a website.\n\nThe vault page doesn't give overage prices for ingestion tokens or storage beyond the free amounts. It also calls the free queries \"semantic\" but the paid ones \"hybrid\", so it's unclear whether those are the same type of query. Check Cloudflare's pricing page if either matters for your plans.\n\nSource: vault page `wiki/Cloudflare AI Search.md`, built from Cloudflare's pricing page as captured on 2026-11-01.\n\nCoverage: vault only. I didn't run a web search because the vault page is still current."
